    "detailed_description": "<strong>Visually impaired can play this game</strong><br><br>In this game you are a scientist who was fiddling with a quantum device that exploded and tore down the universe.<br><br>Some dimensions were merged into one and you must try to repair it... but the most important thing is that all the senses except the hearing sense are neutralized.<br><br><strong>So you can only trust in what you hear.</strong><br><br>Using your ear you'll have to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dodge traps<br></li><li> Hear footsteps of enemies and shoot them <br></li><li> Survive enemy waves<br></li><li> And other things...</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Visually impaired can play this game</strong><br><br>In this game you are a scientist who was fiddling with a quantum device that exploded and tore down the universe.<br><br>Some dimensions were merged into one and you must try to repair it... but the most important thing is that all the senses except the hearing sense are neutralized.<br><br><strong>So you can only trust in what you hear.</strong><br><br>Using your ear you'll have to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dodge traps<br></li><li> Hear footsteps of enemies and shoot them <br></li><li> Survive enemy waves<br></li><li> And other things...</li></ul>",
